caption: • Consequential use of several materially different legal expressions rather than repeated use of one optimized phrase.
engine-rule: consequential-use-of-several-materially-different-legal-expressions-rather-than-repeated-use-of-one-optimized-phrase.

### - Successful use of at least one complex multi-element expression that engages the system's defining grammar or preparation procedure.

### - Demonstrated command of the Tradition's defining resource, failure risk, preparation burden, or other limiting play pattern.

- Creation of at least one durable, transferable, teachable, institutional, environmental, or historically consequential result appropriate to the Tradition.
